<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CVPixelBufferRef</code> is an important intermediate data medium and link in the iOS video capture, processing, and encoding pipeline. Understanding <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CVPixelBufferRef</code> helps you write high-performance, reliable video processing code.</p>

